	// Read-only and unpaginated: there is no page token and no filter, because "is anything holding this group" must not be a multi-request question. The answer is bounded by the live VPCs, clusters and instance groups in the project.
	//
	// Corresponds with GET /v1/regions/{region}/projects/{project}/networking/security-groups/{id}/attachments (the `ListSecurityGroupAttachments` operationId).
