// record a session and set the `k0r_refresh_token` cookie.
//
// **api_key** — Programmatic access via an API key. The caller
// presents the opaque, prefixed API key token. Effective privileges
// are evaluated as the intersection of the key's role list (if set)
// and the creating user's current roles within the key's scope. An
// organization- or project-scoped key's token carries only that
// organization or project and no platform roles; a project-scoped
// key's token also carries no organization-level roles.
//
