// refresh) rather than the request body; non-browser callers send it in the
// body. On success the rotated refresh token is delivered via `Set-Cookie`
// for cookie-based callers (and omitted from the response body for them) and
// in the response body for body-based callers.
//
// All grant types accept optional `scope_narrowing`, which mints an
// access token limited to one organization or project, to a subset of
// roles, or both (see `ScopeNarrowing`). Asking for an organization,
// project or role the credential does not hold returns `403`.
