	// configuration and you cannot swap that configuration in the same instant you
	// call this endpoint; while a fleet is part-way through a rollout, instances on
	// either secret keep working. Store the new secret, deploy it at your own pace,
	// and read `previous_secret_expires_at` for your deadline.
	//
