	// a missing region, or a region the platform does not list or does not host
	// projects in, returns **422 Unprocessable Entity**. Every `regional` entry
	// hosts projects. The `global` entry does only on a deployment that runs
	// compute under `global`, so on any other deployment a create naming `global`
	// returns **422**.
