// List the platform's deployment regions for discovery. The list is operator-declared topology, surfaced read-only so a client can learn which regions exist before addressing a regional resource at /v1/regions/{region}/<service>/.... Modeled on AWS DescribeRegions; any authenticated caller may read it. Get-one (/v1/regions/{region}) is intentionally not offered — that path is owned by region enforcement.
